# Trust Protocol: Criminal Legends

A lightweight browser prototype inspired by co-op dungeon and open-world action fantasy design.

## Features
- Three-character hero roster
- Grappling hook traversal
- Trust meter
- Smartphone/in-game HUD overlay
- Temple switch puzzle loop
- GitHub Pages deployment workflow

## Run locally
```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Then open the local Vite URL.

## Build
```bash
npm run build
```

The generated static output is in the `dist/` directory.

## Deploy
This project includes a GitHub Actions workflow for Pages deployment:
- `.github/workflows/pages-deploy.yml`

The site is built into `dist/` and deployed to GitHub Pages automatically when changes are pushed to `main`.
