# Trust Protocol: Criminal Legends

A playable browser prototype built as a vertical slice for the game concept.

## Features
- 3 hero classes: Blackhujus, Mr. PING, Merhujus
- Skill switching and co-op-inspired team flow
- Trust meter
- Phone UI with diegetic mission messages
- Jungle-temple arena prototype
- GitHub Pages deployment workflow

## Getting started
1. Install dependencies:
   npm install

2. Run locally:
   npm run dev

3. Production build:
   npm run build

## Deployment
This repo includes a GitHub Actions workflow for Pages deployment:
- .github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml

## Controls
- 1 / 2 / 3: switch hero
- A / D: move
- W / Space: jump
- F: action ability
- P: open phone
